msgstr "关于常见的环境、安装和参数问题，请参阅[公开常见问题](../../faqs.md)。"

msgid ""
"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next is a multimodal Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) model and an "
"experimental preview of the architecture that will underpin Qwen4. Its "
"language model combines Gated DeltaNet (GDN) and Qwen Sparse Attention "
"(QSA), gated residual connections, Position Learning Enhancement (PLE), and "
"a native Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) head."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 是一个多模态混合专家（MoE）模型，也是未来支撑 Qwen4 架构的实验性预览版本。其语言模型融合了门控 "
"DeltaNet（GDN）与 Qwen 稀疏注意力（QSA）、门控残差连接、位置学习增强（PLE）以及原生多 Token 预测（MTP）头。"

msgid ""
"The final answer is returned in `choices[0].message.content`, while the "
"parsed reasoning is returned separately in the `reasoning_content` field of "
"the response."
msgstr ""
"最终答案在 `choices[0].message.content` 中返回，而解析后的推理内容则单独在响应的 `reasoning_content` "
"字段中返回。"

