msgstr ""
"| Ascend 950DT系列产品三级池化 PD proxy | `http://127.0.0.1:8249` | `qwen38-megamoe-"
"sp-pd` |"

msgid ""
"Expected result: the service returns HTTP 200 OK with a generated answer in "
"`choices[0].message.content`."
msgstr "预期结果：服务返回 HTTP 200 OK，并在 `choices[0].message.content` 中给出生成的回答。"

msgid ""
"Use a W4A8 checkpoint that includes the vision encoder to verify image-and-"
"text input. Replace `<IMAGE_URL>` with an image URL accessible from the "
"serving environment:"
msgstr "使用包含视觉编码器的 W4A8 权重来验证图文输入。将 `<IMAGE_URL>` 替换为服务环境可访问的图片 URL："

msgid ""
"To disable thinking and request a direct answer, use the following request:"
msgstr "如需禁用思考并请求直接回答，请使用以下请求："

msgid ""
"Follow [Using AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)"
" for evaluation. The results below are for reference. The A3 result is from "
"the W8A8 TP8 × DP1 configuration; validate accuracy for the checkpoint and "
"deployment configuration you use."
msgstr ""
"请按照 [使用 AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md) "
"进行评测。以下结果仅供参考。A3 结果来自 W8A8 TP8 × DP1 配置；请针对你使用的权重和部署配置验证精度。"

msgid ""
"Use the endpoint and served model name for the deployment under test. Record"
" request throughput, output token throughput, time to first token (TTFT), "
"and time per output token (TPOT). Compare configurations using the same "
"input/output lengths and request concurrency."
msgstr ""
"使用被测部署的端点和已服务模型名称。记录请求吞吐量、输出 token 吞吐量、首 token 时延（TTFT）和每输出 token "
"时延（TPOT）。在相同的输入/输出长度和请求并发度下比较各配置。"

msgid ""
"After the service is ready, run this basic text benchmark in a separate "
"terminal. The example targets the A2/A3 colocated service in Section 5.1; "
"for another deployment, use its API address and served model name from "
"[Section 6](#6-functional-verification) and its matching checkpoint for "
"`--model`."
msgstr ""
"服务就绪后，在另一个终端中运行此基础文本基准测试。该示例针对第 5.1 节中的 A2/A3 混部服务；对于其他部署，请使用 [第 6 "
"节](#6-functional-verification) 中的 API 地址和已服务模型名称，并为其 `--model` 使用匹配的权重文件。"

msgid ""
"Confirm that all requests succeed, then record throughput, TTFT, and TPOT "
"from the benchmark summary. These request lengths and concurrency are a "
"starting example; use the same workload when comparing deployments. Refer to"
" [vLLM benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/) for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"确认所有请求均成功，然后从基准测试摘要中记录吞吐量、TTFT 和 "
"TPOT。这些请求长度和并发数是起始示例；在比较不同部署时请使用相同的工作负载。更多详情请参阅 [vLLM "
"benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/)。"

msgid ""
"Use the configuration for your hardware and deployment mode. The table "
"summarizes the commands in [Section 5](#5-online-service-deployment); tune "
"context length, concurrency, and memory utilization for the target workload."
msgstr ""
"请根据您的硬件和部署模式使用相应配置。该表汇总了 [第 5 节](#5-online-service-deployment) "
"中的命令；请针对目标工作负载调整上下文长度、并发数和内存利用率。"

msgid ""
"| Hardware | Deployment / role | Devices | TP × PP × DP | Max model length |"
" Max sequences | Batch tokens |"
msgstr "| 硬件 | 部署 / 角色 | 设备数 | TP × PP × DP | 最大模型长度 | 最大序列数 | 批处理 token 数 |"

msgid ""
"Pair the P/D rows for your hardware. A2 uses two eight-device hosts; A3 uses"
" one 16-device host. A2/A3 Prefill sets `--enforce-eager`; 950DT products "
"Prefill sets `cudagraph_mode=NONE`. All PD Decode examples use "
"`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` with static kernels enabled."
msgstr ""
"请为您的硬件配对相应的 P/D 行。A2 使用两台八设备主机；A3 使用一台 16 设备主机。A2/A3 Prefill 设置 `--enforce-"
"eager`；Ascend 950DT系列产品 Prefill 设置 `cudagraph_mode=NONE`。所有 PD Decode 示例均使用 "
"`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 并启用静态 kernel。"

msgid ""
"Refer to the [Public Performance Tuning "
"Documentation](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)"
" for tuning methods and the [Feature "
"Matrix](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md) for feature "
"descriptions."
msgstr ""
"调优方法请参阅 "
"[公开性能调优文档](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)，功能说明请参阅"
" [特性矩阵](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md)。"

msgid "#### 9.2.1 Tool-Assisted Tuning with msmodeling"
msgstr "#### 9.2.1 使用 msmodeling 进行工具辅助调优"

msgid ""
"MindStudio-Modeling (msmodeling) tunes serving and benchmark parameters "
"using measured results and its knowledge base."
msgstr "MindStudio-Modeling（msmodeling）利用实测结果及其知识库来调优服务与基准测试参数。"

msgid ""
"For instructions, see [Optix-for-PD-"
"disaggregation](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodeling/blob/master/docs/en/quick_start/optix_agent_pd_disaggregation.md)."
msgstr ""
"操作说明请参阅 [Optix-for-PD-"
"disaggregation](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodeling/blob/master/docs/en/quick_start/optix_agent_pd_disaggregation.md)。"

msgid ""
"Model Runner V2 automatically reduces CPU synchronization during decode when"
" the target and MTP attention implementations support it; no extra "
"configuration switch is required. Exact token counts and state remain on the"
" device. Unsupported configurations retain exact CPU synchronization; "
"runtime compatibility checks select the behavior."
msgstr ""
"当目标模型和 MTP 注意力实现支持时，Model Runner V2 会在 decode 期间自动减少 CPU 同步；无需额外的配置开关。精确的 "
"token 计数和状态保留在设备上。不支持的配置仍保留精确的 CPU 同步；运行时兼容性检查会选择相应行为。"

msgid ""
"Use these containers for [MemCache three-tier PD pooling](#55-pd-separation-"
"with-memcache-three-tier-kv-cache-pool). Other deployment modes use Section "
"4.1. Container privileges follow the [MemCache Docker "
"example](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#step-1-prerequisite-"
"checks)."
msgstr ""
"这些容器用于 [MemCache 三级 PD 池化](#55-pd-separation-with-memcache-three-tier-kv-"
"cache-pool)。其他部署模式使用第 4.1 节。容器权限遵循 [MemCache Docker "
"示例](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#step-1-prerequisite-"
"checks)。"

msgid ""
"Prepare storage on the **host**, then create one container per host using "
"the matching hardware tab. Start the services inside the containers as "
"described in Section 5.5."
msgstr "在**主机**上准备存储，然后使用对应的硬件标签页为每台主机创建一个容器。按照第 5.5 节的说明在容器内启动服务。"

msgid ""
"In Section 5.5, `MEMCACHE_FORCE_NEW_DISK` controls "
"`ubsio.standalone.force_new_disk`. Setting it to `true` reinitializes cache "
"storage at startup. Select its value for the target deployment and use only "
"dedicated cache storage."
msgstr ""
"在第 5.5 节中，`MEMCACHE_FORCE_NEW_DISK` 控制 "
"`ubsio.standalone.force_new_disk`。将其设置为 `true` "
"会在启动时重新初始化缓存存储。请根据目标部署选择其值，并且仅使用专用缓存存储。"

msgid ""
"Set `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` before starting Docker. `-e` passes its value into"
" the container, and `-v` mounts the directory at the same path. Section 5.5 "
"copies image templates into this directory and uses those personal files."
msgstr ""
"在启动 Docker 之前设置 `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR`。`-e` 将其值传入容器，`-v` 将该目录挂载到相同路径。第 5.5 "
"节会将镜像模板复制到该目录，并使用这些个人文件。"

msgid ""
"In Section 5.5, set `MEMCACHE_SSD_PATHS` to the device paths mapped by "
"`--device`."
msgstr "在第 5.5 节中，将 `MEMCACHE_SSD_PATHS` 设置为由 `--device` 映射的设备路径。"

msgid ""
"The A3 example in Section 5.5 uses two SSD-backed devices. Set "
"`SSD_DEVICE_PATH` to the first device and `SSD_DEVICE_PATH_2` to the second "
"device prepared above; check both before creating the container. The example"
" device names are `/dev/loop0` and `/dev/loop1`, but use the actual names "
"returned on your host."
msgstr ""
"第 5.5 节中的 A3 示例使用两个 SSD 设备。将 `SSD_DEVICE_PATH` 设置为第一个设备，将 "
"`SSD_DEVICE_PATH_2` 设置为上面准备的第二个设备；在创建容器之前请检查两者。示例设备名称为 `/dev/loop0` 和 "
"`/dev/loop1`，但请使用您主机上返回的实际名称。"

msgid ""
"Use the container name set by `NAME`. New shells inherit "
"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR`; repeat the Section 5.5 library and service exports in"
" each shell. Keep the directory path consistent with the container's "
"environment and mount."
msgstr ""
"使用由 `NAME` 设置的容器名称。新 shell 会继承 `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR`；请在每个 shell 中重复第 5.5 "
"节的库和服务导出。保持目录路径与容器的环境和挂载一致。"

msgid ""
"Check MemCache dependency versions in Section 5.5. Budget pool DRAM and UBS "
"IO memory separately from the container's `/dev/shm` limit (`--shm-size`)."
msgstr ""
"在第 5.5 节中检查 MemCache 依赖版本。请将池 DRAM 和 UBS IO 内存与容器的 `/dev/shm` 限制（`--shm-"
"size`）分开预算。"

msgid ""
"Use the active environment's Mooncake, Torch, and torch_npu library "
"directories. MemCache/MemFabric library paths are set in Section 5.5."
msgstr ""
"使用当前活动环境的 Mooncake、Torch 和 torch_npu 库目录。MemCache/MemFabric 库路径在第 5.5 节中设置。"

msgid ""
"- TP4 × DP1 uses devices 0–3 and a W4A8-MXFP checkpoint. NPU graph extension"
" and static kernels are enabled; super kernels are disabled."
msgstr "- TP4 × DP1 使用设备 0–3 和 W4A8-MXFP 检查点。NPU 图扩展和静态内核已启用；超级内核已禁用。"

msgid ""
"For 950DT products, basic PD, the image-and-text 10K case, and the long-"
"context case use the same Docker container setup from [Section "
"4.1](#41-docker-image-installation), under the `950DT products` tab."
msgstr ""
"对于 Ascend 950DT系列产品，基础 PD、图文 10K 用例和长上下文用例使用 [第 4.1 节](#41-docker-image-"
"installation) 中相同的 Docker 容器设置，位于 `950DT products` 标签页下。"

msgid ""
"- Prefill uses TP4 × PP2 × DP1 in eager mode, with `enable_prefill_mc2=true` and fused MC2 disabled. Check MC2 token limits before increasing the batch budget.\n"
"- Decode uses TP2 × DP4, `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`, NPU graph extension, static kernels, and recompute scheduling; super kernels are disabled.\n"
"- Both roles use three MTP draft tokens, with `enforce_eager=true` on P and `false` on D. Batch tokens are 8192; P/D HCCL buffers are 8192/512.\n"
"- Engram CPU offload requires supported n-gram layers and sufficient host memory. P uses `dp_shared_memory=false`; D uses `true`. Shared-memory DP replicas must share a host and shared-memory namespace.\n"
"- Both roles set prefix caching, Mamba cache mode `align`, and Mamba state dtype `bfloat16`. Keep Mooncake TP/PP/DP declarations consistent with the model commands; clear `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` to use the default partition.\n"
"- Prefill sets `enable_fused_mc2=0` while enabling shared expert overlap."
msgstr ""
"- Prefill 在 eager 模式下使用 TP4 × PP2 × DP1，设置 `enable_prefill_mc2=true` 并禁用融合 MC2。在增加批处理预算之前请检查 MC2 token 限制。\n"
"- Decode 使用 TP2 × DP4、`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`、NPU 图扩展、静态内核和重计算调度；超级内核已禁用。\n"
"- 两个角色均使用三个 MTP 草稿 token，P 上设置 `enforce_eager=true`，D 上设置为 `false`。批处理 token 为 8192；P/D HCCL 缓冲区为 8192/512。\n"
"- Engram CPU 卸载需要受支持的 n-gram 层和足够的主机内存。P 使用 `dp_shared_memory=false`；D 使用 `true`。共享内存 DP 副本必须共享同一主机和共享内存命名空间。\n"
"- 两个角色均设置前缀缓存、Mamba 缓存模式 `align` 和 Mamba 状态数据类型 `bfloat16`。保持 Mooncake TP/PP/DP 声明与模型命令一致；清除 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` 以使用默认分区。\n"
"- Prefill 设置 `enable_fused_mc2=0`，同时启用共享专家重叠。"

msgid ""
"- Each command starts TP2 × DP2 on four devices. `--api-server-count 1` exposes one API endpoint per role; use distinct DP RPC ports for Prefill and Decode.\n"
"- Model Runner V2, async scheduling, and expert parallelism are enabled.\n"
"- Engram uses CPU offload and DP shared memory. DP replicas must share the same host and shared-memory namespace.\n"
"- Prefill enables prefix caching and uses `cudagraph_mode=NONE`; static kernels are disabled.\n"
"- Decode enables prefix caching, `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`, static kernels, and recompute scheduling; MTP sets `enforce_eager=false` to allow graph execution.\n"
"- Both roles enable CPU binding, shared expert DP, FlashComm1, shared expert multistream overlap, and NPU graph extension. Fused MC2, norm/quantization fusion, and super kernels are disabled.\n"
"- Both roles use three MTP draft tokens and `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=4800` for engine startup; model execution uses `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=3000`.\n"
"- Both roles use `HCCL_BUFFSIZE=8192` and `ASCEND_BUFFER_POOL=0:0`. The validated configuration separates Prefill and Decode HCCL base ports (62000/63000) and NPU socket ranges (61400–61499/61500–61599).\n"
"- Keep Mooncake DP2/TP2 declarations consistent with the services. The proxy connects to Prefill on port 8088 and Decode on port 8092. Keep the configured KV base ports at 30000 and 30100; the connector applies rank offsets internally."
msgstr ""
"- 每个命令在四个设备上启动 TP2 × DP2。`--api-server-count 1` 为每个角色暴露一个 API 端点；请为 Prefill 和 Decode 使用不同的 DP RPC 端口。\n"
"- Model Runner V2、异步调度和专家并行已启用。\n"
"- Engram 使用 CPU 卸载和 DP 共享内存。DP 副本必须共享同一主机和共享内存命名空间。\n"
"- Prefill 启用前缀缓存并使用 `cudagraph_mode=NONE`；静态内核已禁用。\n"
"- Decode 启用前缀缓存、`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`、静态内核和重计算调度；MTP 设置 `enforce_eager=false` 以允许图执行。\n"
"- 两个角色均启用 CPU 绑定、共享专家 DP、FlashComm1、共享专家多流重叠和 NPU 图扩展。融合 MC2、归一化/量化融合和超级内核已禁用。\n"
"- 两个角色均使用三个 MTP 草稿 token 和 `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=4800` 用于引擎启动；模型执行使用 `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=3000`。\n"
"- 两个角色均使用 `HCCL_BUFFSIZE=8192` 和 `ASCEND_BUFFER_POOL=0:0`。经验证的配置将 Prefill 和 Decode 的 HCCL 基础端口分开（62000/63000），NPU socket 范围分开（61400–61499/61500–61599）。\n"
"- 保持 Mooncake DP2/TP2 声明与服务一致。代理连接到 Prefill 的 8088 端口和 Decode 的 8092 端口。保持配置的 KV 基础端口为 30000 和 30100；连接器会在内部应用 rank 偏移。"

msgid "### 5.4 Long-Context PD Separation Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.4 长上下文 PD 分离部署"

msgid ""
"This case uses eight devices on one 950DT products host, with TP4 × DP1 for "
"both Prefill and Decode. Both roles set the maximum combined input and "
"output length to 1,010,000 tokens, with up to 16 active sequences and 4096 "
"batch tokens. Initialize the environment as described in [Section "
"4](#4-installation) and run each role in a separate terminal."
msgstr ""
"本用例在一台 Ascend 950DT系列产品主机上使用八个设备，Prefill 和 Decode 均使用 TP4 × "
"DP1。两个角色均将最大输入和输出总长度设置为 1,010,000 个 token，最多支持 16 个活动序列和 4096 个批处理 token。按照 "
"[第 4 节](#4-installation) 的说明初始化环境，并在单独的终端中运行每个角色。"

msgid "!!! note \"Extending the native 256K context to approximately 1M\""
msgstr "!!! note \"将原生 256K 上下文扩展到约 1M\""

msgid ""
"The checkpoint's native context window is 256K (262144 tokens). This long-"
"context case requires all three settings on **both Prefill and Decode**: the"
" complete YaRN `--hf-overrides` shown below, with `factor=4.0` and "
"`original_max_position_embeddings=262144`; `export "
"VLLM_ALLOW_LONG_MAX_MODEL_LEN=1`; and `--max-model-len 1010000`. Keep the "
"YaRN configuration and maximum model length identical on both roles; none of"
" these three settings can be omitted."
msgstr ""
"检查点的原生上下文窗口为 256K（262144 个 token）。本长上下文用例需要在 **Prefill 和 Decode 两者** "
"上设置全部三项配置：如下所示的完整 YaRN `--hf-overrides`，其中 `factor=4.0` 且 "
"`original_max_position_embeddings=262144`；`export "
"VLLM_ALLOW_LONG_MAX_MODEL_LEN=1`；以及 `--max-model-len 1010000`。请保持两个角色上的 YaRN"
" 配置和最大模型长度一致；这三项设置均不可省略。"

msgid ""
"Each request must satisfy `input token count + maximum output token count <="
" max-model-len`. With this configuration, the total must not exceed "
"1,010,000 tokens."
msgstr ""
"每个请求必须满足 `输入 token 数 + 最大输出 token 数 <= max-model-len`。在此配置下，总数不得超过 1,010,000"
" 个 token。"

msgid ""
"The commands reuse ports 8247, 8248, and 8246 from the image-and-text case. "
"Stop that deployment before starting this case."
msgstr "这些命令复用了图文用例中的端口 8247、8248 和 8246。在启动本用例之前，请先停止该部署。"

msgid ""
"Check the startup logs for TP4 × DP1 on both roles and "
"`max_model_len=1010000`. Prepare `long-context-request.json` as a chat-"
"completion request with `model` set to `qwen38-megamoe-sp-pd`, the long "
"input in `messages`, and `max_tokens` set to the required output budget. "
"Keep the processed input plus output budget within 1,010,000 tokens, then "
"run:"
msgstr ""
"检查两个角色的启动日志，确认均为 TP4 × DP1 且 `max_model_len=1010000`。准备 `long-context-"
"request.json` 作为 chat-completion 请求，将 `model` 设置为 `qwen38-megamoe-sp-"
"pd`，长输入放在 `messages` 中，并将 `max_tokens` 设置为所需的输出预算。确保处理后的输入加上输出预算不超过 "
"1,010,000 个 token，然后运行："

msgid ""
"Verify the response content and `usage.prompt_tokens` against the test "
"input. Successful API startup alone does not verify long-context inference."
msgstr "对照测试输入验证响应内容和 `usage.prompt_tokens`。仅 API 成功启动并不能验证长上下文推理。"

msgid ""
"- Both roles use TP4 × DP1 without pipeline parallelism. The Mooncake declarations use `tp_size=4` and `dp_size=1` for both roles.\n"
"    - Prefill disables graph capture and sets MTP `enforce_eager=true`. Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`, sets MTP `enforce_eager=false`, and enables static kernels and recompute scheduling.\n"
"    - Both roles enable Engram CPU offload with `dp_shared_memory=false` and use `HCCL_BUFFSIZE=512`. The supplied configuration sets the engine-ready timeout to 2400 seconds on Prefill and 4800 seconds on Decode; the model-execution timeout is 3000 seconds on both roles.\n"
"    - `VLLM_ASCEND_PLE_BACKEND` only applies to runtimes that implement it; an unknown-variable warning means it has no effect."
msgstr ""
"- 两个角色均使用 TP4 × DP1，不使用流水线并行。Mooncake 声明中两个角色均使用 `tp_size=4` 和 `dp_size=1`。\n"
"    - Prefill 禁用图捕获并设置 MTP `enforce_eager=true`。Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`，设置 MTP `enforce_eager=false`，并启用静态 kernel 和重计算调度。\n"
"    - 两个角色均启用 Engram CPU offload，设置 `dp_shared_memory=false`，并使用 `HCCL_BUFFSIZE=512`。所提供的配置将 Prefill 的引擎就绪超时设置为 2400 秒，Decode 设置为 4800 秒；两个角色的模型执行超时均为 3000 秒。\n"
"    - `VLLM_ASCEND_PLE_BACKEND` 仅适用于实现了该变量的运行时；出现未知变量警告表示它不生效。"

msgid "### 5.5 PD Separation with MemCache Three-Tier KV Cache Pool"
msgstr "### 5.5 基于 MemCache 三级 KV 缓存池的 PD 分离"

msgid ""
"`MultiConnector` combines Mooncake P-to-D transport with MemCache-backed KV "
"caching in HBM, DRAM, and SSD. Each hardware tab contains its complete "
"pooling Prefill and Decode commands. A2/A3 retain the model settings from "
"[Section 5.2](#52-basic-pd-separation-deployment) and add the matching "
"MemCache environment and connector configuration. This section does not "
"cover colocated deployment, the image-and-text 10K case, or the long-context"
" case."
msgstr ""
"`MultiConnector` 将 Mooncake 的 P 到 D 传输与基于 MemCache 的 HBM、DRAM 和 SSD 三级 KV "
"缓存相结合。每个硬件标签页都包含其完整的池化 Prefill 和 Decode 命令。A2/A3 沿用[第 5.2 节](#52-basic-pd-"
"separation-deployment)中的模型设置，并添加相应的 MemCache 环境和连接器配置。本节不涉及混合部署、图文 10K "
"用例或长上下文用例。"

msgid ""
"In the Prefill terminal, first apply the library exports at the beginning of"
" Section 5.5 and the **Set the service environment** block above, then run "
"the following commands."
msgstr "在 Prefill 终端中，先应用第 5.5 节开头的库导出设置以及上方的 **设置服务环境** 代码块，然后运行以下命令。"

msgid ""
"In the Decode terminal, first apply the library exports at the beginning of "
"Section 5.5 and the **Set the service environment** block above, then run "
"the following commands."
msgstr "在 Decode 终端中，先应用第 5.5 节开头的库导出设置以及上方的 **设置服务环境** 代码块，然后运行以下命令。"

msgid ""
"The tested configuration sets `lookup_rpc_port` to `\"0\"` for Prefill and "
"`\"1\"` for Decode."
msgstr "测试配置将 Prefill 的 `lookup_rpc_port` 设置为 `\"0\"`，将 Decode 的设置为 `\"1\"`。"

msgid ""
"| 950DT products long-context PD proxy | `http://127.0.0.1:8246` | "
"`qwen38-megamoe-sp-pd` |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend 950DT系列产品长上下文 PD 代理 | `http://127.0.0.1:8246` | `qwen38-megamoe-sp-"
"pd` |"

